WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:35.670 --> 01:38.240
Congratulations to you,
Student Council President.

01:38.840 --> 01:40.700
You've done well, Vanilla.

01:41.270 --> 01:43.740
Did you use your magic?

01:44.240 --> 01:46.740
Is that how I got elected?

01:47.580 --> 01:52.000
If you hadn't done anything,
would Chocolat-chan have won?

01:52.850 --> 01:54.010
What of it?

01:56.050 --> 02:00.190
Are you saying I've done
something I shouldn't have?

02:01.830 --> 02:02.690
No.

02:03.300 --> 02:05.550
I wanted to become Student
Council President...

02:06.430 --> 02:09.500
because I didn't want to lose to
Chocolat-chan, no matter what.

02:10.270 --> 02:14.000
I understand, Vanilla. There's no
longer any need for concern.

02:14.640 --> 02:18.980
But your heart's true desire was not to
become Student Council President.

02:20.050 --> 02:23.750
I will let you become Queen.

02:25.180 --> 02:26.980
But there is one condition.

02:27.550 --> 02:30.320
Some refer to that tree
as a "False Acacia"...

02:30.990 --> 02:34.030
even though it's rightly called
a Black Locust tree.

02:34.030 --> 02:38.260
Yet it's insultingly called a "fake" just
because it resembles an Acacia.

02:39.560 --> 02:41.470
It's the same for us...

02:41.470 --> 02:46.340
Les Royaumes exiled us from the Magical
World and labeled us "Ogres."

02:48.210 --> 02:51.210
I know.  But Mama...

02:52.040 --> 02:55.350
Queen Candy wishes to unify
Les Royaumes and the Ogres.

02:55.350 --> 02:57.010
There's no way she could do such a thing.

02:58.820 --> 03:01.650
Even supposing the Queen
did want to do that,

03:01.650 --> 03:04.560
there are still many within Les Royaumes
who despise us Ogres...

03:04.560 --> 03:06.760
and desire our extermination.

03:07.560 --> 03:08.990
Do you understand, Vanilla?

03:08.990 --> 03:10.260
That's the reason.

03:11.060 --> 03:14.570
You're the daughter of a Queen that
desires coexistence with the Ogres.

03:14.570 --> 03:18.210
Therefore, some people in La Palais don't
want to see you succeed the throne.

03:19.800 --> 03:22.890
They suggested
the Queen Selection Test...

03:22.890 --> 03:25.010
to avoid the inconvenience
of you becoming Queen.

03:26.380 --> 03:28.510
Haven't you noticed already?

03:29.410 --> 03:31.880
They all want to make
Chocolat the Queen.

03:32.850 --> 03:35.050
Even your own mother...

03:37.460 --> 03:40.120
You don't have a single ally
among Les Royaumes.

03:40.930 --> 03:42.960
You're all alone now.

03:45.000 --> 03:48.530
Birth of the Ogre Queen.

03:53.810 --> 03:56.040
Vanilla still hasn't come home.

03:56.310 --> 03:57.540
I will never let you...

03:58.240 --> 04:00.540
have the Queen's throne.

04:01.080 --> 04:03.210
I've never seen Vanilla
act like that before.

04:05.020 --> 04:06.220
It's just a fight.

04:07.620 --> 04:10.550
I'm sure we'll make up
like we always do.

04:11.860 --> 04:12.760
Danger!

04:14.490 --> 04:17.130
You shouldn't leave Vanilla all alone.

04:19.500 --> 04:22.650
Chocolat, where's Vanilla?
Wasn't she with you?

04:23.770 --> 04:24.900
We got into a fight.

04:25.570 --> 04:28.170
Really? You couldn't have
picked a worse time.

04:28.610 --> 04:30.410
All right, I'll go look for her.

04:31.140 --> 04:32.410
What is it, Robin?

04:33.110 --> 04:34.750
I have a bad feeling about this.

04:35.350 --> 04:37.670
Vanilla's name is right below yours...

04:37.670 --> 04:39.250
on Pierre's hit list.

04:41.590 --> 04:43.120
Don't leave Vanilla alone.

04:45.590 --> 04:46.860
Alone?

04:47.390 --> 04:50.490
That's right.
You've always been all alone.

04:51.000 --> 04:53.730
Even when you were surrounded
by many people,

04:53.730 --> 04:55.640
you've always been alone.

04:57.070 --> 04:59.370
But you have me with you now.

05:00.070 --> 05:02.340
I will make you a Queen...

05:02.340 --> 05:05.360
The Magical World's
first Ogre Queen.

05:05.810 --> 05:08.480
You'll make me... the Ogre Queen?

05:08.480 --> 05:11.410
Am I just your second choice after
Chocolat-chan turned you down?

05:13.520 --> 05:16.150
You're the one I've chosen, Vanilla.

05:16.150 --> 05:19.460
You're lying!  You're the
same as everyone else!

05:20.390 --> 05:21.870
You don't...

05:21.870 --> 05:24.090
You don't really like me!

05:24.630 --> 05:26.770
I could never "like" anyone.

05:26.770 --> 05:30.070
Chocolat certainly is Queen material,

05:30.700 --> 05:33.940
and has the blood of the legendary
witch Cinnamon in her veins.

05:34.470 --> 05:37.780
That's why I thought I'd make
her the Ogre Queen.

05:38.910 --> 05:40.940
But I realized that I was mistaken.

05:41.450 --> 05:43.790
Chocolat can't become
the Ogre Queen.

05:44.150 --> 05:47.650
She couldn't possibly understand
the Ogres' pain and sorrow,

05:47.650 --> 05:50.790
just like she can't understand yours.

05:50.790 --> 05:53.620
Chocolat is our enemy.

05:55.160 --> 05:57.290
Chocolat-chan is... the enemy?

05:58.130 --> 06:01.630
If you still think I'm lying, go to
Chocolat and confirm for yourself...

06:04.040 --> 06:06.740
that I am your only ally.

06:15.880 --> 06:17.720
Vanilla, where have you been?

06:17.720 --> 06:19.550
Everyone was really
worried about you.

06:20.150 --> 06:22.390
But I'm so glad you're back!

06:22.390 --> 06:25.320
You're hungry, right?
Let's make dinner!

06:25.920 --> 06:26.820
Chocolat-chan...

06:27.690 --> 06:31.260
Vanilla, what's wrong?
You look so pale.

06:32.800 --> 06:34.670
A doll... a jewel box...

06:34.670 --> 06:38.300
A huge bouquet of roses, cookies,
a dress, and a tiara.

06:38.840 --> 06:41.810
It's as if I have everything,
yet I have nothing at all.

06:42.540 --> 06:44.640
Chocolat-chan's the one everyone likes.

06:44.640 --> 06:47.050
Pranks, mischief, loud laughter...

06:47.050 --> 06:49.280
I can't take part in any of it.

06:50.120 --> 06:53.050
I'm always by myself,
watching from the sidelines.

06:53.690 --> 06:55.810
There never was any place for me.

06:55.810 --> 06:58.190
What happened to you, Vanilla?

06:58.190 --> 07:00.090
What did Pierre say to you?

07:00.090 --> 07:03.800
The Queen's throne is the
only place I have left.

07:03.800 --> 07:08.230
That's why I can't let anyone
else have it, no matter what.

07:08.230 --> 07:08.820
But still...!

07:12.970 --> 07:13.800
Vanilla.

07:14.470 --> 07:15.310
Sorry.

07:17.040 --> 07:19.410
But I just don't want
to see you right now!

07:19.910 --> 07:21.120
So please leave, Chocolat!

07:21.550 --> 07:24.310
Vanilla, what is it? What happened?

07:25.380 --> 07:29.390
Chocolat wouldn't understand
the pain and sorrow you feel.

07:31.510 --> 07:33.010
Farewell, Chocolat-chan!

07:34.490 --> 07:36.660
Sugar Sugar Rune, Vani Rune!

07:37.100 --> 07:37.930
Wand!

07:38.560 --> 07:40.730
Blizzard of Bubbles!

07:41.230 --> 07:42.300
Vanilla!

07:43.800 --> 07:45.440
What's going on??

07:57.820 --> 07:58.880
Chocolat-chan!

08:01.590 --> 08:04.220
I have come to retrieve
you, Vanilla-sama.

08:17.100 --> 08:18.570
Hey, Hiroshi, wait for me!

08:20.940 --> 08:24.810
What's gotten into you tonight?

08:26.640 --> 08:28.280
You see something
down there, boy?

08:32.850 --> 08:33.980
Kato!

08:40.290 --> 08:42.330
Hiroshi! Long time no see!

08:42.690 --> 08:45.060
What are you doing out here?

08:45.060 --> 08:46.900
It's 9:00 already!

08:46.900 --> 08:49.300
I'm staying out here tonight.

08:50.340 --> 08:53.300
For the night?
You're staying under the bridge?!

08:53.810 --> 08:57.370
These falling jasmine petals are
making a bed of flowers for me.

08:58.580 --> 08:59.680
What a weirdo.

08:59.680 --> 09:00.640
See ya!

09:01.650 --> 09:04.620
Umm, be careful not to catch a cold!

09:05.450 --> 09:07.620
It's not cold at all,
so I'll be fine.

09:15.790 --> 09:16.730
Akira?

09:17.930 --> 09:20.700
It's just too dangerous to stay outside.
Come over to my place.

09:22.930 --> 09:25.970
Even aliens like you should
use some common sense.

09:29.340 --> 09:30.310
How strange.

09:30.910 --> 09:33.640
I' d always thought Akira
was so childish.

09:34.710 --> 09:37.760
He's silly, reckless,
and always calling me an alien.

09:37.760 --> 09:40.580
But tonight, he seems so different.

09:41.290 --> 09:43.420
I've never seen
this side of him at school.

09:45.020 --> 09:47.260
Is it because of the
jasmine's fragrance?

09:47.860 --> 09:50.660
Clearly I don't know a thing about Akira.

09:51.200 --> 09:53.930
Just like I didn't know
anything about Vanilla.

09:54.970 --> 09:58.670
Black pajamas, one bag of
rasberry-chocolate candy,

09:59.470 --> 10:02.110
my two favorite outfits, Mama's diary,

10:02.740 --> 10:05.280
and the gold brush
that Vanilla gave me.

10:05.810 --> 10:09.780
She only needed a moment to put
all the things I like in this bag.

10:10.550 --> 10:12.850
What's Vanilla doing now?

10:13.850 --> 10:16.190
Is she crying by herself like I am?

10:27.970 --> 10:30.000
Welcome, Vanilla-sama.

10:32.540 --> 10:34.400
Thanks for coming, Vanilla.

10:36.110 --> 10:37.610
Is everything ready?

10:37.610 --> 10:40.810
Yes, the way for her
has been prepared.

10:45.820 --> 10:46.620
Follow me.

10:52.720 --> 10:55.230
I've already made up my
mind, so I won't be scared.

10:59.060 --> 11:04.070
They are the weakest of the Ogres,
who can only move in darkness.

11:04.970 --> 11:09.310
They live off the energy from
the Noir hearts that I collect.

11:10.110 --> 11:12.110
So you're taking care of them?

11:12.740 --> 11:16.250
Les Royaumes would confine
the weak against their will...

11:16.250 --> 11:17.750
but I wouldn't.

11:18.720 --> 11:21.790
Pierre hates Les Royaumes...

11:21.790 --> 11:23.720
but then again, so do I.

11:25.120 --> 11:27.060
And somewhere in his heart,
he's must've always...

11:27.060 --> 11:30.760
hated Chocolat-chan for
being so similar to the Queen.

11:30.760 --> 11:35.400
There's hatred in Pierre's heart...
and in mine.

11:36.870 --> 11:40.870
Now that we know that,
there's no turning back.

11:41.370 --> 11:43.310
Now, step over here.

11:45.110 --> 11:47.430
It's a Noir heart of hatred.

11:48.150 --> 11:52.940
Even in the Magical World,
only we Ogres can use Noir hearts.

11:53.520 --> 11:55.220
Should a regular mage touch one...

11:55.220 --> 11:58.940
their magic would be drained
away, as would their life.

12:01.230 --> 12:04.930
Those who suffer from jealousy,
hatred, and solitude...

12:04.930 --> 12:07.230
are most suited to wield this heart.

12:08.270 --> 12:12.440
As long as we walk on the same path,
there's no way I can defeat Chocolat-chan.

12:12.440 --> 12:15.170
Yes, this is what I've
chosen for myself.

12:15.770 --> 12:17.800
Farewell, Royaumes.

12:18.140 --> 12:19.300
Farewell, Mama.

12:22.050 --> 12:24.020
Farewell, Chocolat.

12:24.580 --> 12:27.750
I will be reborn, stronger than ever.

12:28.720 --> 12:31.590
As a Queen who can
even rule over darkness.

12:44.140 --> 12:46.530
What's wrong, Kato?

12:46.970 --> 12:48.870
You're not yourself tonight.

12:50.340 --> 12:52.810
Did you get into a fight with Ice?

12:54.080 --> 12:55.910
Did I guess right?

12:55.910 --> 12:58.880
Still, it's nothing
to get depressed about.

12:58.880 --> 13:02.650
People fight all the time.
You'll be making up before you know it.

13:03.590 --> 13:05.820
I thought things
would play out like that,

13:05.820 --> 13:08.460
but it looks so hopeless this time.

13:09.660 --> 13:11.930
Why would you think that?

13:11.930 --> 13:14.770
Haven't you and Ice been
friends for a long time?

13:15.430 --> 13:16.570
I don't understand.

13:17.470 --> 13:21.610
I always thought Vanilla was
my best friend in the world.

13:21.610 --> 13:24.440
But I just don't know anymore.

13:24.440 --> 13:26.880
You don't even know
if you're friends or not?

13:26.880 --> 13:28.580
Are you kidding me?

13:28.580 --> 13:30.550
I don't know who's to blame here,

13:30.550 --> 13:33.280
but if you think you are,
even a little bit...

13:33.280 --> 13:35.550
just go and apologize to her!

13:36.450 --> 13:39.790
If you do that, I'm sure
Ice will forgive you.

13:40.420 --> 13:44.360
Stop wasting time here
and go apologize to her!

13:44.360 --> 13:47.300
If you go now, maybe
you can still be friends.

13:47.930 --> 13:50.300
If I go now, maybe...

13:50.300 --> 13:52.400
Akira, thank you!

13:52.400 --> 13:55.240
I'm gonna go talk
to Vanilla right now!

13:56.270 --> 13:59.520
Oh, and if Ice is to blame,
just be your usual self.

13:59.910 --> 14:03.570
Whup her butt!
That'll open her eyes for sure!

14:07.790 --> 14:11.080
That's... some
very strong Noir energy.

14:11.620 --> 14:13.290
Pierre's house... ?

14:13.830 --> 14:15.090
It can't be!

14:15.090 --> 14:16.190
Robin-sensei!

14:16.190 --> 14:19.560
We couldn't find Vanilla
at school or in town.

14:19.560 --> 14:21.700
Is that light... magic?

14:21.700 --> 14:23.000
Pierre's house?

14:23.540 --> 14:24.700
Hey guys!

14:25.140 --> 14:27.000
Chocolat, what's going on?

14:27.000 --> 14:29.180
Vanilla came back home!

14:29.710 --> 14:31.810
But... we got into another fight.

14:31.810 --> 14:34.310
Oh, so she's at home.

14:34.310 --> 14:37.420
We need to ask her what happened.

14:37.420 --> 14:39.180
Let's go, Robin-sensei!

14:39.780 --> 14:43.290
No. Chances are, Vanilla
isn't at home anymore.

14:44.690 --> 14:46.590
Farewell, Chocolat-chan!

14:46.590 --> 14:49.160
Now that you mention it,
Vanilla bid me farewell!

14:50.290 --> 14:53.330
As I thought, she's likely
gone to Pierre's house.

14:53.330 --> 14:54.400
To Pierre's?

14:54.400 --> 14:55.370
No way...

14:56.270 --> 14:57.400
Just as I expected.

14:58.270 --> 15:01.380
Have everyone get ready
to welcome our guests.

15:01.380 --> 15:03.070
Yes Sir.

15:03.070 --> 15:04.910
It's our princess' debut.

15:10.130 --> 15:12.680
There's Noir energy
swirling all around.

15:13.280 --> 15:14.890
Vanilla's in there?

15:14.890 --> 15:17.560
I'll break down this door
with my magic!

15:17.560 --> 15:18.680
No!

15:19.060 --> 15:21.130
It's dangerous to rush at it.

15:21.130 --> 15:26.530
For normal mages, careless contact
with Noir energy can be fatal.

15:26.530 --> 15:28.160
Sesamme, un deux trois!

15:29.900 --> 15:32.650
Damn, my unlocking magic didn't work.

15:32.650 --> 15:35.010
The barrier is too strong to overpower.

15:35.010 --> 15:36.660
I'll give it a try!

15:37.380 --> 15:38.110
Chocolat!

15:38.110 --> 15:38.740
Stop!

15:41.450 --> 15:43.210
The door wasn't locked.

15:45.120 --> 15:46.620
The scent of decayed roses...

15:48.950 --> 15:50.220
Wait, Chocolat!

15:55.090 --> 15:56.430
Oh no, it's a trap!

15:57.500 --> 15:58.190
Chocolat!

16:03.030 --> 16:04.970
This is the inside of Pierre's house.

16:05.870 --> 16:08.440
There are people
here, lots of them.

16:13.640 --> 16:14.440
Vanilla!

16:15.680 --> 16:16.950
Let's go home, Vanilla!

16:17.480 --> 16:19.180
Everyone's waiting for us outside!

16:19.180 --> 16:21.550
We've been looking all over for you!

16:21.550 --> 16:24.450
They're searching for me
for your sake.

16:25.360 --> 16:28.460
It's not for me, so
don't assume that it is.

16:30.290 --> 16:33.200
Vanilla has been
reborn with a Noir heart.

16:33.200 --> 16:34.730
Pierre...

16:34.730 --> 16:37.220
She's not the meek
Vanilla she used to be.

16:37.970 --> 16:41.340
Vanilla, why don't
you show Chocolat...

16:41.340 --> 16:43.370
your true form?

16:43.370 --> 16:44.730
Understood, Pierre.

16:45.640 --> 16:47.710
Sugar Sugar Rune, Vani Rune!

16:58.090 --> 16:59.960
That's... Vanilla?

17:00.490 --> 17:01.960
How do I look, Chocolat-chan?

17:02.430 --> 17:04.960
I've become the Ogre Princess.

17:05.630 --> 17:07.960
The Ogre... Princess?

17:08.730 --> 17:10.910
Eventually, Vanilla will become Queen.

17:10.910 --> 17:13.970
The Magical World's
first Ogre's Queen.

17:14.470 --> 17:16.470
I won't let that happen!

17:17.140 --> 17:19.480
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

17:21.110 --> 17:22.280
Briller Etoile!

17:24.120 --> 17:25.820
Darkness, begone!

17:25.820 --> 17:27.690
Wake up, Vanilla!

17:29.250 --> 17:31.060
Vanilla, come home with me!

17:31.060 --> 17:32.790
How long are you going to keep sulking!

17:33.620 --> 17:36.090
Stop it! Leave me alone!

17:36.090 --> 17:37.030
Vanilla!

17:37.030 --> 17:38.960
This is typical Chocolat-chan.

17:39.630 --> 17:43.700
You boast and brag
like you're always right!

17:45.140 --> 17:48.470
I've put up with it for awhile,
but enough is enough.

17:49.110 --> 17:51.710
You don't understand
my feelings at all!

17:51.710 --> 17:53.210
Vanilla, I...

17:53.210 --> 17:55.280
Looks like you still don't get it.

17:55.280 --> 17:56.710
She's not the
old Vanilla anymore.

17:57.420 --> 18:01.220
Vanilla, why don't you show
her your Noir energy?

18:01.650 --> 18:03.890
Sugar Sugar Rune, Vani Rune!

18:04.720 --> 18:06.720
Self-Pitying Tears of Ice!

18:08.560 --> 18:12.960
This spell will bring one's
saddest thoughts to the surface.

18:15.430 --> 18:17.670
You don't have to
use that spell;

18:17.670 --> 18:19.660
I've NEVER felt sadder
than I do right now!!

18:21.870 --> 18:23.410
You brought this upon yourself.

18:23.870 --> 18:27.640
I gave you a golden opportunity to
avoid fighting, and you blew it.

18:28.150 --> 18:30.550
You chose the path
of conflict, Chocolat.

18:31.520 --> 18:36.090
In time, both the Magical World and the
Human World will belong to the Ogres.

18:36.090 --> 18:39.930
Everyone will have to bow
down before the Ogre Queen.

18:40.620 --> 18:44.560
Vanilla, you never tell me anything.

18:45.260 --> 18:46.680
You're such a fool!

18:51.000 --> 18:53.270
Should we have let her go so easily?

18:53.740 --> 18:55.530
We have to sow
the seeds of sadness.

18:56.170 --> 18:58.810
Eventually, even
Chocolat's heart will...

18:58.810 --> 19:02.110
That's right. This is a good
way to kill a little time.

19:02.110 --> 19:03.980
We can't let this end so soon.

19:03.980 --> 19:05.490
Let her go!

19:06.280 --> 19:07.620
Grand Lumiere!

19:10.090 --> 19:12.320
All that and not even
a scratch on the door.

19:12.320 --> 19:16.390
It's not only fortified with magic,
but also with a huge amount of ecure.

19:16.390 --> 19:17.230
Ecure?

19:17.860 --> 19:20.930
The energy  extracted
from the Noir hearts.

19:20.930 --> 19:23.530
Noir energy is doing all this?

19:23.530 --> 19:25.870
What about Chocolat, Sensei?

19:28.370 --> 19:29.370
Chocolat!

19:33.510 --> 19:34.280
Are you okay?

19:35.110 --> 19:37.710
My tears won't stop!

19:41.020 --> 19:42.990
Vanilla became the Ogre Princess?

19:42.990 --> 19:44.520
Curse that Pierre.

19:44.520 --> 19:45.860
But don't worry,

19:45.860 --> 19:49.560
I'm sure Robin-sensei can get
Vanilla back from the Ogres.

19:50.260 --> 19:51.710
No, this is one thing I can't do.

19:53.130 --> 19:56.630
We'd have to remove the Noir
heart that's inside Vanilla.

19:56.630 --> 20:00.840
But that would require very
high-level magic and lots of ecure.

20:00.840 --> 20:02.680
Even you can't do it, Robin-sensei?

20:03.210 --> 20:06.710
Then I'll do it!
I will get Vanilla back!

20:06.710 --> 20:10.770
Chocolat, Vanilla might
not ever come back...

20:12.150 --> 20:14.780
Not while she has that
Noir heart inside her.

20:15.850 --> 20:18.790
We'll help too. Right, Saule?

20:18.790 --> 20:21.280
Right, so don't cry anymore.

20:26.560 --> 20:29.770
Chocolat's still crying...
how uncool!

20:29.770 --> 20:33.100
Shut up, Saule! I'm sad,
so of course I'm gonna cry!

20:33.100 --> 20:37.010
In the Magical World, it's very
embarrassing if other people see you cry...

20:39.280 --> 20:41.510
I don't even understand
my own feelings.

20:42.250 --> 20:44.510
Who knew Vanilla
thought of me like that?

20:45.520 --> 20:49.520
I finally realized
how much I've hurt her.

20:50.220 --> 20:55.260
And I'm the one who's lonely
after being separated from her.

20:55.830 --> 20:58.560
Chocolat, you are a Queen Candidate.

20:58.560 --> 21:01.230
I understand that you're
worried about Vanilla, but...

21:01.230 --> 21:05.070
the fate of the Magical World rests
on the selection of the new Queen.

21:05.070 --> 21:07.300
It's an extremely important matter.

21:07.300 --> 21:09.670
If you keep sobbing away like this,

21:09.670 --> 21:12.200
the Magical World will fall into
the hands of the Ogres.

21:13.410 --> 21:14.540
Would you want that?

21:15.750 --> 21:18.980
I just don't want to fight
with Vanilla anymore.

21:18.980 --> 21:20.750
Consider it carefully, Chocolat.

21:20.750 --> 21:24.750
Right now, you two are just like your
mother Cinnamon and Queen Candy.

21:25.290 --> 21:27.630
You've chosen the path
of becoming Queen.

21:27.630 --> 21:32.680
Aspiring Queens must keep the entire
Magical World in mind when taking action.

21:33.230 --> 21:37.900
Being a Queen candidate means
prioritizing the Magical World's welfare,

21:37.900 --> 21:41.400
even if it means losing a friend.

21:43.270 --> 21:48.650
Mama and Queen Candy were friends,
just like me and Vanilla.

21:49.910 --> 21:51.880
Am I walking the same
path as my mother?

21:57.320 --> 21:58.290
Good morning!

21:59.520 --> 22:00.320
Good morning.

22:04.970 --> 22:07.970
Vanilla seems like a
completely different person.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:47.770 --> 23:51.220
Vanilla, do we really have
to fight each other?

23:52.160 --> 23:56.980
I don't know what Pierre told you,
but a black heart doesn't suit you at all!

23:58.470 --> 23:59.380
Oh yeah!

23:59.800 --> 24:02.660
Maybe I should take
Vanilla's black heart.

24:02.660 --> 24:05.380
If I do that, she might
become my friend again.

24:06.350 --> 24:08.190
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.830 --> 24:10.520
The Black Needle of Jealousy.

24:11.310 --> 24:13.470
I will get Vanilla back.
